name: sim.duplicateGraphCurveToStatic
description: Duplicates a graph stream or curve, and freezes it
luaSynopsis: int staticCurveId = sim.duplicateGraphCurveToStatic(int graphHandle, int curveId, string staticCurveName)
pythonSynopsis: int staticCurveId = sim.duplicateGraphCurveToStatic(int graphHandle, int curveId, string staticCurveName)
inputs:
1. graphHandle: handle of the graph
2. curveId: id of the stream or curve
3. staticCurveName: name of the new static stream/curve
outputs:
1. staticCurveId: id of the created static stream or curve
